WEBVTT

00:00:03.052 --> 00:00:07.431
The visitor from far away
came across some nice friends.

00:00:08.724 --> 00:00:10.100
However...

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:14.230
What is with the
whole cosplay-looking getup?

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:17.525
How come her form doesn't
confound mankind's imagination?

00:00:17.608 --> 00:00:20.027
Aliens are supposed
to be mind-based creatures,

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:22.530
or silicon-based creatures
with bio-acceleration devices,

00:00:22.613 --> 00:00:23.822
or sentient mechanical beings,

00:00:23.906 --> 00:00:26.825
or radiosymmetrical exoskeletal creatures,

00:00:26.909 --> 00:00:29.411
with forms that are compelling enough to say

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:33.249
"Ah, this is a messenger from
the vastness of the universe!"

00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:37.628
Not even Trekkies will accept
such a sorry excuse for an alien!

00:00:42.591 --> 00:00:44.760
For a beautiful contact!

00:00:44.843 --> 00:00:47.096
For a beautiful contact.

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:49.515
We will not allow a
creature who looks like that

00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:52.518
to be the object of mankind's First Contact.

00:00:53.561 --> 00:00:56.063
Yummm!

00:00:56.146 --> 00:01:00.818
Delicious! So delicious!
What do you call this dish?

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:03.445
We just call this "yakiniku."

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:06.115
The sweetness of the blackened parts,

00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.701
together with the harmony
of the firm chewiness of the meat

00:01:08.784 --> 00:01:12.621
as the grease runs off from the
heat of the rice and mixes together...

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:18.961
Ah, it's great! It's so great!
I'm so glad I came to Earth!

00:01:24.592 --> 00:01:27.928
Eris, why do you
folks travel through space?

00:01:28.012 --> 00:01:32.433
Our main goal is to go sightseeing
and expand our social network.

00:01:32.516 --> 00:01:35.019
Those of us in Catia
have started to feel like

00:01:35.102 --> 00:01:39.023
we've come to a standstill,
both culturally and genetically.

00:01:39.106 --> 00:01:41.066
Come to a standstill?

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:44.194
For 70,000 years,
our society has remained stable,

00:01:44.278 --> 00:01:46.655
and we've done everything to death.

00:01:47.698 --> 00:01:49.617
So we went off into space,

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.746
to exchange ideas with those
of other races, and be stimulated!

00:01:53.829 --> 00:01:55.623
That's why.

00:01:56.373 --> 00:02:00.711
The bluebird of happiness
is quite close at hand, huh?

00:02:00.794 --> 00:02:03.047
So what do we do, Jack?

00:02:04.673 --> 00:02:08.218
Okinawa is already a difficult place to work.

00:02:08.302 --> 00:02:11.430
I'll put together an operation,
and I'll need your support.

00:02:14.016 --> 00:02:17.519
Space exploration, huh? I sure am jealous.

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:19.480
Of what?

00:02:19.563 --> 00:02:21.982
It's a job where you can dream.

00:02:22.066 --> 00:02:26.028
| still haven't found anything
that I want to do for a living.

00:02:27.321 --> 00:02:31.950
Manami has already decided
to be an employee on the base.

00:02:32.034 --> 00:02:35.287
I'm not yet familiar with the
social systems of this world,

00:02:35.371 --> 00:02:37.706
but I think you'll be fine
as long as you don't give up.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.749
Don't give up?

00:02:38.832 --> 00:02:41.377
Yes, in searching.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.628
Mm-hmm.

00:02:43.504 --> 00:02:48.550
Oh, yeah. As far as compensation goes...

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:50.219
Compensation?

00:02:50.844 --> 00:02:55.391
You've done so much for me,
and given the social structure here,

00:02:55.474 --> 00:02:58.560
it's only natural that I pay
some form of compensation, right?

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:00.729
Hmm, I suppose you might be right.

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.440
Um, until our relations are formalized,

00:03:03.524 --> 00:03:05.526
| can't offer you any kind of money,

00:03:05.609 --> 00:03:08.737
so the question becomes
one of doing things some other way.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:12.658
A-According to the materials
| read, in a case like this...

00:03:12.741 --> 00:03:16.286
I-I should pay with my body...

00:03:17.996 --> 00:03:21.667
O-Our reproductive systems are quite similar,

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.295
and I believe it possible to perform the act...

00:03:25.379 --> 00:03:28.424
J-Just a minute!
What materials did you look at?!

00:03:28.507 --> 00:03:32.261
That's what it says in
the books under your bed, Kio.

00:03:32.344 --> 00:03:35.973
I-It's not like that! That's just fiction!

00:03:36.056 --> 00:03:38.308
Huh? Is that right?

00:03:39.435 --> 00:03:43.355
Thank goodness. I'm still in my 16th age,

00:03:43.439 --> 00:03:45.357
and I have no reproductive act experience,

00:03:45.441 --> 00:03:46.942
so I wasn't sure what to do.

00:03:47.025 --> 00:03:49.862
Th-That's good to hear, right?

00:03:49.945 --> 00:03:51.321
Yes!

00:03:53.574 --> 00:03:55.033
How filthy.

00:03:58.912 --> 00:04:00.122
Here, go ahead.

00:04:00.122 --> 00:04:00.581
"Rainbow Kids"
Here, go ahead.

00:04:00.581 --> 00:04:02.040
"Rainbow Kids"

00:04:06.295 --> 00:04:07.671
I'm dreaming...

00:04:07.755 --> 00:04:11.884
Yes, I'm dreaming.
I'm a person from another world.

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:16.847
Yo, Kio!

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:18.307
Are you planting something?

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.517
Eris said she wanted to
introduce me to someone.

00:04:20.601 --> 00:04:22.394
Introduce you?

00:04:34.406 --> 00:04:36.283
Fall in, everyone!

00:04:39.036 --> 00:04:40.996
Operations check. Dance!

00:04:44.082 --> 00:04:45.667
Stand proud!

00:04:47.544 --> 00:04:49.129
Look sorry!

00:04:52.466 --> 00:04:53.842
Sing!

00:04:56.094 --> 00:04:58.889
Self-determination functions normal.

00:04:58.972 --> 00:05:00.974
Um, what are these?

00:05:01.058 --> 00:05:02.559
Assistroids.

00:05:02.643 --> 00:05:05.938
When you scatter
these nanomachine capsules,

00:05:06.021 --> 00:05:09.274
the elements of the soil are
reconstructed, and they are born.

00:05:09.358 --> 00:05:12.027
| thought I'd have them help in my research.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.530
Maybe I should plant some, too.

00:05:19.952 --> 00:05:23.580
Ugh... it's so hot...

00:05:23.664 --> 00:05:26.625
Eris, you must have trouble taking the heat.

00:05:26.708 --> 00:05:28.293
Okay, hold on.

00:05:33.632 --> 00:05:36.301
Here. This should help
take your mind off the heat.

00:05:36.385 --> 00:05:37.302
What is it?

00:05:37.386 --> 00:05:39.513
Eat it, and you'll see.

00:05:42.766 --> 00:05:46.562
It's cold, and it's sweet, and it's soft! Delicious!

00:05:47.437 --> 00:05:48.397
Good.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.190
What do you have there?

00:05:50.274 --> 00:05:51.233
Purple sweet-potato.

00:05:51.316 --> 00:05:53.360
Can I have a little taste?

00:05:53.443 --> 00:05:55.028
Be my guest.

00:05:56.446 --> 00:05:58.198
We've got to move on this, now.

00:05:58.282 --> 00:06:02.661
There are too many people around.
It's not good to be in such a rush.

00:06:40.949 --> 00:06:41.992
At this rate,

00:06:42.075 --> 00:06:45.120
| should be able to gather all
the important data in about a week.

00:06:45.203 --> 00:06:47.122
Wow, that's amazing.

00:06:48.206 --> 00:06:50.167
It's hot again.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.211
| thought it had gotten a lot cooler.

00:06:53.295 --> 00:06:55.339
Want some more ice cream?

00:06:55.422 --> 00:06:56.798
Yes!

00:06:58.508 --> 00:06:59.301
They're out.

00:06:59.343 --> 00:07:00.636
It's almost time, Momiji.

00:07:00.719 --> 00:07:02.512
Activate System 7.

00:07:07.726 --> 00:07:10.646
Huh? Isn't there anyone around?

00:07:13.649 --> 00:07:14.441
--A power outage?

00:07:14.441 --> 00:07:16.026
--Don't move!
--A power outage?

00:07:19.738 --> 00:07:20.322
What?!

00:07:20.364 --> 00:07:23.200
We are from the secret society,
Beautiful Contact.

00:07:23.283 --> 00:07:24.284
You there! The alien!

00:07:24.368 --> 00:07:25.869
Y-Yes?

00:07:25.953 --> 00:07:28.580
For the sake of the development of mankind,

00:07:28.664 --> 00:07:32.000
we refuse contact with members of your race!

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:34.294
Remove yourself from
this planet immediately!

00:07:34.378 --> 00:07:37.047
The situation has changed.
Stand by for now.

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:37.923
Jack...?

00:07:38.006 --> 00:07:39.841
Let's wait and see what happens.

00:07:39.925 --> 00:07:43.261
Um, excuse me for asking,
but who are you?

00:07:43.345 --> 00:07:45.931
We are representatives of mankind.

00:07:46.014 --> 00:07:51.812
Er, more specifically,
what part of humanity do you represent?

00:07:51.895 --> 00:07:53.313
You don't need to know!

00:07:53.397 --> 00:07:56.149
| am here performing an assessment,

00:07:56.233 --> 00:07:58.193
so I would like to ask for your opinions.

00:07:58.276 --> 00:08:02.739
As such, I must ask you for
more details about your organization.

00:08:02.823 --> 00:08:04.491
So, if you could please tell me...

00:08:04.574 --> 00:08:05.575
| can't tell you.

00:08:05.659 --> 00:08:06.660
Why is that?

00:08:06.743 --> 00:08:08.996
Because we are a secret society!

00:08:11.832 --> 00:08:16.211
Ah! I suppose you're right!
| did not put that together.

00:08:16.294 --> 00:08:18.255
Are you mocking us?!

00:08:18.338 --> 00:08:19.339
Stop!

00:08:19.423 --> 00:08:20.716
Move!

00:08:20.799 --> 00:08:21.758
Kio!

00:08:22.009 --> 00:08:23.385
Kio!

00:08:29.057 --> 00:08:30.434
Kio...

00:08:31.601 --> 00:08:32.978
What?!

00:08:37.315 --> 00:08:38.775
Equip S-1!

00:08:50.412 --> 00:08:52.372
The target is the priority!

00:08:52.456 --> 00:08:53.832
Copy.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.050
She's nimble. In that case...

00:09:03.133 --> 00:09:04.509
Stop!

00:09:05.677 --> 00:09:07.345
| said stop!

00:09:07.429 --> 00:09:08.638
Kakazu...

00:09:08.722 --> 00:09:09.514
Kio!

00:09:09.598 --> 00:09:10.640
Please, run away!

00:09:10.724 --> 00:09:13.101
Eris hasn't done anything wrong!

00:09:13.185 --> 00:09:15.145
So why are you doing this?!

00:09:22.444 --> 00:09:24.029
Th-Thanks.

00:09:26.323 --> 00:09:28.033
Are you all right, Kio?

00:09:28.116 --> 00:09:32.954
I'm fine. Are you okay, Eris?

00:09:33.038 --> 00:09:34.623
What's wrong? Carry on with the mission.

00:09:34.706 --> 00:09:37.000
I'm suspending the mission
based on my field assessment.

00:09:37.084 --> 00:09:39.753
That's not your call to make, Momiji!

00:09:45.258 --> 00:09:47.844
Eris!

00:09:47.928 --> 00:09:49.304
Kakazu!

00:09:51.723 --> 00:09:53.100
Kio!

00:09:55.936 --> 00:09:58.230
They didn't have to shoot Kio, too...

00:10:05.112 --> 00:10:06.071
Where am I?

00:10:06.154 --> 00:10:07.948
You're awake, Kio?

00:10:08.031 --> 00:10:09.825
Uncle Yuichi?

00:10:10.784 --> 00:10:11.701
Where's Eris?!

00:10:11.785 --> 00:10:14.204
It was all I could do just to pick you up.

00:10:14.287 --> 00:10:15.497
We have to go help her!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:18.333
You're pretty aggressive, huh, my nephew?

00:10:19.167 --> 00:10:23.130
It's not that. Eris hasn't done anything.

00:10:23.213 --> 00:10:25.465
What are we going to
do if Eris starts hating the Earth

00:10:25.549 --> 00:10:28.260
because of all this?

00:10:28.343 --> 00:10:31.096
We have to help her.
We have to show her that she has

00:10:31.179 --> 00:10:33.306
at least one person on her side.

00:10:43.358 --> 00:10:44.818
Manami?

00:10:44.901 --> 00:10:47.320
Kio? W-What is it?

00:10:47.404 --> 00:10:49.489
Do you know where Eris is?

00:10:49.573 --> 00:10:53.243
Huh? No, I don't. Why?

00:10:53.326 --> 00:10:54.828
Where is Eris?

00:10:54.911 --> 00:10:56.329
| told you, I don't know.

00:10:56.413 --> 00:10:58.748
| saw your watch back there.

00:10:58.832 --> 00:11:03.670
With the crack in the same place,
on the same type of watch as yours.

00:11:04.921 --> 00:11:07.132
That was you, right, Manami?

00:11:08.425 --> 00:11:09.759
Yes.

00:11:09.843 --> 00:11:11.928
Why did you do that?

00:11:12.012 --> 00:11:14.097
| wanted some field experience.

00:11:14.181 --> 00:11:17.517
You do know that I'm trying
to get a job on the base, right?

00:11:17.601 --> 00:11:18.435
Mm-hmm.

00:11:18.518 --> 00:11:23.815
To be more precise, a job as
a CIA field partner on the base.

00:11:23.899 --> 00:11:25.066
Oh...

00:11:25.901 --> 00:11:28.111
<i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry, okay?</i>

00:11:28.195 --> 00:11:31.198
It's all right. What's done is done.

00:11:31.281 --> 00:11:34.242
But you have to tell me where Eris is.

00:11:36.703 --> 00:11:39.164
She says she's in Kadena, in Hangar F.

00:11:39.247 --> 00:11:41.333
It won't be easy to get on the base.

00:11:41.416 --> 00:11:44.377
Then I guess we'll need a guide.

00:11:45.629 --> 00:11:46.922
W-What's this?

00:11:47.005 --> 00:11:49.716
Smith & Wesson Mé686.

00:11:50.842 --> 00:11:54.512
They're tranquilizer rounds,
so you can shoot without worry.

00:11:54.596 --> 00:11:57.974
Um, Uncle, what do you do for a living?

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:03.897
You're done here.
This is now under our jurisdiction.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.941
Ordering the CIA around?

00:12:06.024 --> 00:12:08.109
The DIA sure is standing tall.

00:12:08.193 --> 00:12:09.444
What are you talking about?

00:12:09.527 --> 00:12:13.365
We are all servants of the people, aren't we?

00:12:14.658 --> 00:12:18.453
Hmph, you're a relic of a bygone era.

00:12:18.536 --> 00:12:20.914
Hello, are you the lieutenant?

00:12:20.997 --> 00:12:22.958
Yeah, Lieutenant Fujioka.

00:12:23.041 --> 00:12:24.709
Yes, this is Futaba.

00:12:24.793 --> 00:12:26.836
Good evening. This is Kakazu.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.964
Oh, yes?

00:12:29.047 --> 00:12:33.927
Listen... about tomorrow... I'm sorry.

00:12:35.011 --> 00:12:39.349
Something has come up,
and I may not be back for a while.

00:12:39.432 --> 00:12:40.475
Where are you going?

00:12:40.558 --> 00:12:43.478
Well, it's a long story.

00:12:43.561 --> 00:12:45.272
Once I get back, I'll give you a call, okay?

00:12:45.355 --> 00:12:47.065
Y-Yeah...

00:12:47.148 --> 00:12:49.276
Okay, talk to you later.

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:56.866
We blew it.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.618
Nah, the government apparently doesn't mean

00:12:58.702 --> 00:13:01.454
to enter diplomatic relations
with them. Our objective--

00:13:01.538 --> 00:13:04.416
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:13:05.667 --> 00:13:08.878
| wonder if I could ask you all not to move.

00:13:08.962 --> 00:13:11.214
Who are you people?!

00:13:11.298 --> 00:13:12.674
Miss ltokazu?!

00:13:13.717 --> 00:13:15.635
Okay everyone, "cheese."

00:13:15.719 --> 00:13:17.304
What are you doing?!

00:13:17.387 --> 00:13:19.889
We're going to distribute these
photos on the net,

00:13:19.973 --> 00:13:22.934
exposing the members of
the hardcore sci-fi secret society,

00:13:23.018 --> 00:13:24.394
Beautiful Contact.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:27.272
If you don't want that...

00:13:33.653 --> 00:13:36.072
He hates me now, all right.

00:13:40.243 --> 00:13:41.828
Oh, it's you...

00:13:47.625 --> 00:13:49.336
That's your Y-number plate for you.

00:13:49.419 --> 00:13:51.129
It has to do with the hour, too.

00:13:51.212 --> 00:13:53.923
The guys on base are all Trekkies.

00:13:54.007 --> 00:13:57.886
Their competence drops
to below 30% when it's on.

00:14:05.518 --> 00:14:06.478
Where am I?

00:14:06.561 --> 00:14:09.189
Um, hello there...

00:14:09.272 --> 00:14:10.690
Aw, man...

00:14:10.774 --> 00:14:12.609
You look confused.

00:14:14.569 --> 00:14:16.071
What do you--

00:14:16.154 --> 00:14:17.238
--What do you need?

00:14:17.322 --> 00:14:19.074
--What's going to happen to me?
--What do you need?

00:14:19.157 --> 00:14:22.702
You're going to die.
Your existence is problematic, you see.

00:14:22.786 --> 00:14:25.121
You could be detrimental to
our national interests.

00:14:25.205 --> 00:14:29.876
Why do you not officially
refuse any relations with us?

00:14:31.795 --> 00:14:34.381
Do you have a prior commitment?

00:14:34.464 --> 00:14:36.091
| have no need to answer you.

00:14:36.174 --> 00:14:41.012
| see. Incidentally, you smell of dog.

00:14:41.096 --> 00:14:42.263
| knew it.

00:14:42.347 --> 00:14:43.598
The rules of the universe state

00:14:43.681 --> 00:14:46.935
that relations with dog
people constitute illegal trading.

00:14:47.018 --> 00:14:50.563
We should do away
with creatures like you at once.

00:14:55.026 --> 00:14:56.653
What was that?!

00:14:56.736 --> 00:14:58.988
Ooh! Aah!

00:14:59.072 --> 00:15:01.324
All right, one more blast!

00:15:05.829 --> 00:15:08.289
What are you planning to do?

00:15:08.373 --> 00:15:09.749
We're going to go save Eris.

00:15:09.833 --> 00:15:11.376
No, it's too dangerous!

00:15:11.459 --> 00:15:13.586
Eris is in even more danger.

00:15:14.421 --> 00:15:17.382
Sorry, but from here on, you'll have to walk.

00:15:28.977 --> 00:15:31.146
We'll draw the enemy's attention.

00:15:31.229 --> 00:15:34.983
Aw, I guess I can
cross joining the CIA off my list.

00:15:35.066 --> 00:15:38.361
The Japanese government
will be coming after me over this.

00:15:38.445 --> 00:15:40.405
Can you use that?

00:15:41.656 --> 00:15:43.700
It's just like the MGC.

00:15:57.172 --> 00:15:57.922
--Sweet.

00:15:57.922 --> 00:15:59.340
--A few minor options.
--Sweet.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:15:59.716
"Please do not find mas a good homs" --A few minor options.
--Sweet.

00:15:59.716 --> 00:16:01.926
"Please do not find mas a good homs"

00:16:19.903 --> 00:16:22.572
This is it. Hangar F.

00:16:23.615 --> 00:16:26.534
What the...? What the
hell is happening outside?!

00:16:26.618 --> 00:16:29.913
Well, it's about time for me to leave.

00:16:32.457 --> 00:16:33.833
I-Impossible!

00:16:34.584 --> 00:16:38.046
This outfit is a scaled-down powered suit.

00:16:39.339 --> 00:16:42.592
| suppose I don't need
to hold back against someone

00:16:42.675 --> 00:16:45.345
who would conduct
illegal trading with dog people.

00:16:55.438 --> 00:16:57.065
What?

00:16:57.148 --> 00:16:58.691
Huh? Kio?

00:16:58.775 --> 00:16:59.901
Eris!

00:16:59.984 --> 00:17:01.361
Kio!

00:17:02.278 --> 00:17:03.738
Why are you here?

00:17:03.821 --> 00:17:06.866
Why? I came to rescue you, of course.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.786
Then, Kio, you created
that commotion outside?

00:17:09.869 --> 00:17:11.579
Yeah, but judging by things in here,

00:17:11.663 --> 00:17:14.123
you may have been
all right without me coming.

00:17:16.584 --> 00:17:19.337
Thank you very much, Kio!

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:22.674
| am extremely happy!

00:17:22.757 --> 00:17:24.092
E-Eris!

00:17:24.175 --> 00:17:26.844
It's all right! It's all right!

00:17:33.726 --> 00:17:36.145
Oh, no! Is this the end?

00:17:39.399 --> 00:17:41.192
Uncle Yuichi!

00:17:43.945 --> 00:17:44.779
Where's Kio?

00:17:44.862 --> 00:17:45.863
How are you coming, Kio?

00:17:45.947 --> 00:17:50.201
I've rescued Eris.
We're in Miss Itokazu's car right now.

00:17:55.331 --> 00:17:57.584
Meet up on the runway, right?

00:17:57.667 --> 00:18:00.086
Huh? Manami and Futaba?

00:18:00.169 --> 00:18:01.379
Yeah.

00:18:01.462 --> 00:18:03.548
You're pretty popular with the ladies, huh?

00:18:07.927 --> 00:18:10.513
How are you planning
to get away from here?

00:18:10.597 --> 00:18:12.849
We requested
a helicopter to pick us up.

00:18:12.932 --> 00:18:15.435
Who knows if they can fly it well enough?

00:18:15.518 --> 00:18:16.728
They?

00:18:16.811 --> 00:18:19.314
It's all right. See?

00:18:23.401 --> 00:18:25.945
Keep it coming, and land over here.

00:18:31.576 --> 00:18:32.452
Tanks!

00:18:32.535 --> 00:18:34.829
Aw, geez, the jig is up.

00:18:34.912 --> 00:18:37.206
What do we do, Futaba?

00:18:39.083 --> 00:18:42.754
We just have to do away
with those battle machines, right?

00:18:42.837 --> 00:18:45.798
You guys are all right?

00:18:45.882 --> 00:18:49.427
All right then, everyone,
prepare to demilitarize them!

00:18:51.137 --> 00:18:54.057
Face the target and commence the charge!

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.725
That's crazy, Eris!

00:18:55.808 --> 00:18:58.478
It's all right. I'm going, too.

00:19:02.607 --> 00:19:03.983
Eris!

00:19:09.906 --> 00:19:12.992
Pseudo-antimatter hammers, activate!

00:19:13.076 --> 00:19:16.287
All of you, turn into shiny dust!

00:19:50.154 --> 00:19:53.491
The incident was reported as an
explosive mishap at the fuel depot,

00:19:53.574 --> 00:19:56.786
and the truth was kept
from the eyes of the world.

00:19:56.869 --> 00:20:00.289
And so, almost as
if nothing had happened,

00:20:00.373 --> 00:20:04.794
the rest of summer vacation
went by as it had before.

00:20:04.877 --> 00:20:07.004
That's all of the data, right?

00:20:07.088 --> 00:20:09.632
Huh? You're not going to the library today?

00:20:10.675 --> 00:20:13.928
No. We've already copied most
of the material there,

00:20:14.011 --> 00:20:15.763
and I've sent off my report.

00:20:15.847 --> 00:20:17.932
Then, you're leaving?

00:20:18.015 --> 00:20:21.102
Yes. Thank you for all that you've done.

00:20:22.395 --> 00:20:25.481
Yeah, of course. It's your job, and all.

00:20:25.565 --> 00:20:31.487
Um, Kio, I was very happy
when you came to save me earlier.

00:20:31.571 --> 00:20:34.824
To think that you would
come to that dangerous place, I...

00:20:34.907 --> 00:20:38.703
Huh? Oh, you know...
We're friends, after all.

00:20:38.786 --> 00:20:43.207
U-Um, listen... in just a little while,

00:20:43.291 --> 00:20:46.169
I'll be entering my first mating season.

00:20:46.252 --> 00:20:48.254
Mating... season...?

00:20:48.337 --> 00:20:54.969
I, um... I was wondering, Kio,
if you wouldn't mind being my mate.

00:20:55.052 --> 00:20:57.430
Mate? By that, you wouldn't mean...

00:20:57.513 --> 00:21:00.266
Kio! Bad news!

00:21:00.349 --> 00:21:02.894
Kakazu, um, on the TV...

00:21:06.063 --> 00:21:07.023
Huh?

00:21:07.106 --> 00:21:09.108
What is the mother ship doing here?

00:21:10.526 --> 00:21:12.904
Eris! Eris, are you here?!

00:21:14.989 --> 00:21:19.702
Chief! What's going on?
| thought you were still observing.

00:21:19.786 --> 00:21:22.663
Well, you know how
there was that taste engram data

00:21:22.747 --> 00:21:24.999
for that dish called
"yakiniku" in your report?

00:21:25.082 --> 00:21:28.586
That has become quite
a craze aboard the mother ship.

00:21:28.669 --> 00:21:31.464
Everyone was saying
that they wanted to eat yakiniku.

00:21:31.547 --> 00:21:36.052
So, we decided to
formally establish cordial relations,

00:21:36.135 --> 00:21:39.138
and we've come
here as the advance party.

00:21:39.222 --> 00:21:40.264
My goodness...

00:21:40.348 --> 00:21:42.975
And so, abrupt though it might be...

00:21:44.143 --> 00:21:46.103
We've dropped by!

00:21:55.822 --> 00:21:57.573
I'm still inexperienced

00:21:57.657 --> 00:22:03.329
There are many answers before my eyes

00:22:03.412 --> 00:22:10.545
How many equal parts
can you divide one sky into?

00:22:10.628 --> 00:22:12.421
Give me them all,
because they're so much fun

00:22:12.505 --> 00:22:14.173
I want them all to myself

00:22:14.257 --> 00:22:17.635
My true colors spill into the blue sky

00:22:17.718 --> 00:22:25.351
Man! I'll write your
name down so I don't lose it

00:22:25.434 --> 00:22:27.144
Why don't you get serious?

00:22:27.228 --> 00:22:32.400
I won't let you tell me you don't like to

00:22:32.483 --> 00:22:39.156
A pure love device (Set up now) and start it up

00:22:39.240 --> 00:22:43.202
On a runway of impatience and dreams

00:22:43.286 --> 00:22:47.081
fasten your seatbelt even tighter

00:22:47.164 --> 00:22:53.963
A cutting-edge device
(Back up now) it's starting up

00:22:54.046 --> 00:22:58.009
I want the original

00:22:58.092 --> 00:23:01.721
of your heart, at least,

00:23:01.804 --> 00:23:05.725
and I've put together a plan

00:23:19.071 --> 00:23:21.282
Just as I expected, they failed.

00:23:21.365 --> 00:23:25.286
My word, the whole planet
is full of useless people.

00:23:28.831 --> 00:23:30.458
When the mob of girls have a sleepover,

00:23:30.541 --> 00:23:32.293
they happily yet bashfully share a bath.

00:23:32.376 --> 00:23:33.878
It's a pajama party, off-limits to boys,

00:23:33.961 --> 00:23:36.130
with a Gothic Lolita Maid surprise!

00:23:36.213 --> 00:23:38.549
Next time, "We've Come to Stay.”

00:23:38.633 --> 00:23:42.303
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
